@startuml architecture
title Appointment Reminder System - High Level Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Infomed Slis Server (MS SQL Server)" {
  [Slis Database] as SlisDB
  [Change Tracking] as CT
}

package "Sync Layer" {
  [Linked Server Connection] as LS
  [SQL Server Agent Job: Sync] as SyncJob
}

package "Own Operational DB (MS SQL Server)" {
  [Appointments Table]
  [Patients Table]
  [Notifications Table]
  [SyncState Table]
}

package "Reminder Service (Python)" {
  [reminder_service.py] as ReminderScript
  [easysms_client.py] as ApiClient
}

package "Webhook Receiver (Flask / Python)" {
  [callback_receiver.py] as CallbackApp
  [GET/POST /api/sms-callback] as CallbackEndpoint
}

cloud "easysms.gr API" {
  [api/mobile/check]
  [api/viber/send]
  [api/sms/send]
}

SlisDB --> CT : enables
CT --> LS : exposes changes via CHANGETABLE
LS --> SyncJob : queried by
SyncJob --> [Appointments Table] : MERGE / upsert
SyncJob --> [SyncState Table] : reads/writes last version

[Appointments Table] --> ReminderScript : reads due appointments
ReminderScript --> ApiClient : uses
ApiClient --> [api/mobile/check] : validate number
ApiClient --> [api/viber/send] : send Viber (sms_fallback=true)
ApiClient --> [api/sms/send] : direct SMS fallback
ReminderScript --> [Notifications Table] : log sent status

[api/sms/send] --> CallbackEndpoint : delivery report callback
CallbackApp --> [Notifications Table] : update delivery status

@enduml